(*internal/format.TimeFormat).appendOp (*internal/format.TimeFormat).appendOps	# a %c, %x or %X formats the locale's pattern: at most three deep, since a pattern that refers to itself, directly or through the others, throws when the locale is built (TimeLocale.resolve) and a format that uses it never runs (internal/format/timeformat.go: appendOp, appendOps); the bytes each writes are bounded by MaxLocaleExpansion = 4096, checked in NewTimeLocale; test internal/format/depth_test.go
